{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSRange","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"range","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"withCoordinates:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"coords","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"range","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The range of vertices to replace. The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"location"},{"text":" field indicates","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" being the first vertex, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"text":" field indicates the number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices to replace.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"coords","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this array is copied to the shape’s "},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"